{
  "_comment": "Business-type presets for first-run onboarding (AGENT.md § 1 beat 2). The chosen type pre-configures defaults — a starting point, not a cage: everything stays overridable in registry.json settings.business_type after setup. scripts/business-preset.sh reads this file; do not rename keys without updating that script and docs/ONBOARDING-BUSINESS-PRESETS.md.",
